[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0010","text":"好的，没问题\nStraylight的各位，谢谢你们"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0020","text":"感觉，挺不错的呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0030","text":"嗯！\n正式演出也能顺利就好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0040","text":"……\n冬优子酱，发生什么事了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0050","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0060","text":"总觉得你精神不集中。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0070","text":"……是吗？\n我觉得是你想多了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0080","text":"才不是。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0090","text":"……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0100","text":"……对了！　冬优，得给制作人\n打个电话才行！　我先离开一下！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0102","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0103","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0110","text":"（……啊，走神了……\n　这里，是关系者区域外面……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0000","text":"音乐节观众"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0120","text":"──今天Straylight要出场吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0130","text":"！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0001","text":"音乐节观众"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0140","text":"嗯，就是芹泽朝日在的那个组合\n最近经常看到呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0150","text":"…………\n没事，我知道的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0160","text":"（哦，有自动贩卖机）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0002","text":"工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0170","text":"──Straylight，感觉很不错啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0003","text":"工作人员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0180","text":"嗯，特别是中心那个孩子的动作\n让人移不开眼"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0190","text":"（……朝日，果然厉害啊～\n　超受关注的！）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_05020000_01_0200","text":"──啊，糟了！\n差不多该回去了！"}]
